      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "総計 五百六十七人（そうけい ごひゃくろくじゅうしちにん）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Grand total: 567 men. Kurobane's establishment, and the arithmetic closes on the facing leaf lower_p203_right, which I opened and read: 銃兵八小隊 總數四百八十人 (480) + 豫備銃兵三十二人 (32) + the artillery company's 都合四十五人 (45, being 36 gunners plus 7 officers and 2 signalmen) + 役員十人 (10) = 567. Note that the artillery enters at 45, the whole company, not at the 36 gunners alone."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "黑羽總計"
      }
    ],
